{"text": "In the eleventh round Tom put everything he had left into one last attack, and the crowd roared, begging him to finish it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sandel went down once more, but he rose at nine and held onto the ropes, covering his face and body with his arms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Toms legs were heavy and his knuckles ached, and his blows, which had no strength left in them, fell weakly on the young mans shoulders. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Too tired even to raise his arm in defense, he saw Sandels glove coming toward his jaw, and then, all at once, everything went black. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he woke in his corner, the fight was lost, and he could think only that a piece of steak would have made the difference. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom refused all help and walked out of the hall alone, and when a man at a pub offered him a drink, he hesitated and walked on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He sat down on a bench in the Domain, afraid to face Lizzie, who was waiting up for him, and he felt sick with hunger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he covered his face with his hands and cried, and now at last he understood why Stowsher Bill had cried in the dressing room so long ago.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "l", "e", "v", "e", "n", "t", "h", " ", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "T", "o", "m", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "l", "e", "f", "t", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "a", "t", "t", "a", "c", "k", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "r", "o", "w", "d", " ", "r", "o", "a", "r", "e", "d", ",", " ", "b", "e", "g", "g", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "i", "n", "i", "s", "h", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "n", "d", "e", "l", " ", "w",